    "title": "Job fair at Vibrant Arena aims to help thousands of workers displaced by Tyson plant closure - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KWQC Staff ,\n5 hours ago QUAD CITIES, Ill./Iowa (KWQC) - Businesses across the Quad Cities are being asked to step up and help more than 2,500 Tyson Joslin workers left without a job. The American Job Center in Rock Island and IowaWorks are partnering to host a job fair for skilled workers from noon-4 p.m. Sept. 2 at Vibrant Arena at The Mark in Moline. Read full article\n2",
